12-Jan-15 Electric Company      Expenses:Utilities           $50.00       $50.00
12-Feb-15 Electric Company      Expenses:Utilities           $55.00      $105.00
12-Feb-20 Electric Company      Expenses:Utilities           10 EUR      $105.00
                                                                          10 EUR

Grocer
